---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" title="About Us">
  <div class="prose prose-amber max-w-none space-y-10">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-amber-900 border-b-2 border-amber-200 pb-2">About Vallalaar Aathi Inam</h2>
    
    <section>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-800">1. Our History - Vallalaar Aathi Inam</h3>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
        Vallalaar Aathi Inam was established to preserve and propagate the ancient wisdom of the path of light. The name reflects our dedication to the original lineage of Vallalaar's teachings, focusing on the essence of human unity and spiritual evolution.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-800">2. What is Olineri?</h3>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
        "Olineri" literally translates to the "Path of Light." It is a spiritual framework that guides individuals toward achieving a "Deathless Great Life" by transforming the physical body through compassion, discipline, and divine grace.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-800">3. Our Founder</h3>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
        The organization was founded by a visionary dedicated to the principles of Suddha Sanmargam. Through years of meditation and study, our founder established these halls to provide a space for seekers to learn the practical aspects of achieving the purpose of birth.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-800">4. Chennai & Trichy Sabhai</h3>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
        We maintain two primary spiritual halls: the Chennai Sabhai, which serves as a hub for urban practitioners, and the Trichy Sabhai, which is deeply rooted in traditional service and meditation practices.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-800">5. Services Done</h3>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
        Each Sabhai undertakes unique services. While Chennai focuses on weekly teachings and discourse, Trichy is renowned for its dedicated food donation (Annadhanam) and organizing large-scale spiritual gatherings.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>